e downward from the blind median (~3.5%) to approximately 3.50%, with tight uncertainty given the near-term evidence.\n\nFINAL: 3.50\n\n```json\n{\"percentiles\": {\"5\": 3.35, \"10\": 3.40, \"20\": 3.44, \"40\": 3.48, \"60\": 3.53, \"80\": 3.60, \"90\": 3.68, \"95\": 3.75}}\n```",
